{"unit_id":"TelosmaYLX__dsh-session-notify#card-zh","repo":"TelosmaYLX/dsh-session-notify","commit":"e3468abb8098ab376f34ed1747cc30a835d734e0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-notify 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话提醒插件。它监听会话轮次结束，并把完成、出错、中止、阻塞或达到 token 上限等结果写入会话日志，同时通过浏览器系统通知或页内提示提醒用户；AI 提问和权限审批也会触发提醒。用户可在设置面板调整语言、通知通道和各场景文案，并把用时、token 用量、缓存命中率和生成速度放进模板。适合希望离开会话页面时仍能及时获知任务状态的 Web 用户；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:492-530","lib/client.js:803-845","lib/client.js:1126-1140"]}
{"unit_id":"TelosmaYLX__dsh-session-notify#card-en","repo":"TelosmaYLX/dsh-session-notify","commit":"e3468abb8098ab376f34ed1747cc30a835d734e0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-notify alerts DSH Web users when sessions finish or need an answer or approval. It records turn results and shows browser notifications or an in-page toast. Customize languages, delivery modes, and templates with session duration and token statistics. No API key or account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:492-530","lib/client.js:803-845","lib/client.js:1126-1140"]}
